  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Vertical scroll triggers: 4 entries of 3 bytes. Byte 0 is the screen row of Rockford, bytes 1-2 are the scroll speed for that row."},
    {"at":12,"placement":"line","text":"Horizontal scroll triggers: 4 entries of 3 bytes. Byte 0 is the screen column of Rockford, bytes 1-2 are the scroll speed for that column."},
    {"at":24,"placement":"line","text":"When no pixel scroll is in progress on an axis, calculates the screen column and the screen row of Rockford in cells."},
    {"at":32,"placement":"line","text":"Sets rockford_view_col to rockford_col minus the view column in cells (scroll_x_char / 2)."},
    {"at":50,"placement":"line","text":"Sets rockford_view_row to rockford_row minus the view row in cells (scroll_y_char / 2)."},
    {"at":61,"placement":"line","text":"Values for $D016 (multicolour mode and fine X scroll) for the horizontal scroll phases 0-3."},
    {"at":65,"placement":"line","text":"Values for $D011 (fine Y scroll) for the vertical scroll phases 0-3."},
    {"at":69,"placement":"line","text":"Moves the view vertically by scroll_y_speed. Sets the fine Y scroll of the play area split. At a phase change, it moves view_ptr by one character row ($50). At rest, it moves only on even frames."},
    {"at":106,"placement":"side","text":"Bits 7-6 of scroll_y_frac give the phase 0-3."},
    {"at":167,"placement":"line","text":"Moves the view up one character row and starts at phase 3."},
    {"at":190,"placement":"line","text":"Moves the view horizontally by scroll_x_speed. Sets the fine X scroll of the play area split. At a phase change, it moves view_ptr by one character. At rest, it moves only on even frames."},
    {"at":248,"placement":"side","text":"Not reached: in an intermission, update_scroll stops when start_delay is 0."},
    {"at":291,"placement":"line","text":"Moves the view left one character and starts at phase 3."},
    {"at":314,"placement":"line","text":"Stops the scroll at the edges of the map buffer: row 0 and row 21, column 0 and column 42."},
    {"at":373,"placement":"line","text":"Scrolls down when Rockford is at screen row 11 or lower, and up when he is above screen row 5."},
    {"at":402,"placement":"line","text":"Scrolls right when Rockford is at screen column 17 or more, and left when he is left of screen column 3."},
    {"at":431,"placement":"line","text":"Sets the scroll speeds from the trigger tables and the screen position of Rockford, then applies the screen edge limits. During the start delay, a stopped scroll also takes the speed of an entry whose position is more than the position of Rockford."},
    {"at":530,"placement":"line","text":"Scrolls the view to follow Rockford. In an intermission, the view scrolls only during the start delay."}
  ],
